\[
Q = \pi \left( \frac{d}{2} \right)^2 \cdot v
\]

where \( d \) is the diameter of the pipe and \( v \) is the velocity of the fluid. Rearranging to solve for \( v \):

\[
v = \frac{4Q}{\pi d^2}
\]

