   \]
   \[
   0.44 = \frac{1}{r^{0.41}}
   \]
   \[
   r^{0.41} = \frac{1}{0.44} \approx 2.31
   \]
   \[
   r = 2.31^{1/0.41} \approx 2.31^{2.44 \times 1} \approx 2.21
   \]
   The compression ratio is \(\boxed{2.21}\).

