\[
\alpha^n x^{n+1} + 3.5x + 0.8 = 0,
\]
where \( x = \frac{F_{23}}{P_0} \) and \( \alpha = \frac{P_0}{A\tau_0} \).
</USER_REQUEST>

<ASSISTANT_RESPONSE>
